              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The data presented here were collected as part of the EMPHASIS project:\n<li><b>Behavioural.csv</b>: CSV-file with the behavioural results (response, reaction time) per trial and participant.</li>\n<li><b>Fixations.csv</b>: CSV-file with the fixation data (location, duration, etc.) for each trial and participant.</li>\n<li><b>Saccades.csv</b>: CSV-file with the saccade data (location, duration, etc.) for each trial and participant.</li>\n<li><b>Fixation_proportions.csv</b>: CSV-file with the fixation proportions on pre-defined AOIs (eyes, nose, mouth, and hands) for each trial and participant.</li>\n<li><b>Demographics.csv</b>: CSV-file with the demographic data of all participants (age, gender)</li>\n<li><b>READMEs</b>: README-files (plain text documents) for each CSV-file. Includes a short explanation of the experiment and variables included in the CSV-file.</li>\n<li>The data collected from younger participants can also be found here: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.34894/4XDHZ8\">10.34894/4XDHZ8</a>"
                },
